It feels like my first computer did. This is the single most in-depth
project I have ever done in a long career in design and UI/UX. This is
my magnum opus.

Hermit the Trog is an artist and mad scientist, but not a coder. AI
(Claude) coded this. All the logic, systems, workflows and art are the
